Hi,

Please review the patch set that supports amdgpu VM update via CPU. This fe=
ature provides improved performance for compute (HSA) where mapping / unmap=
ping is carried out (by Kernel) independent of command submissions (done di=
rectly by user space). This version doesn't support shadow copy of VM page =
tables for CPU based update.

Best Regards,
Harish


